'''Mekako Saionji''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] gains massive damage against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] and a 100% chance to slow Aliens. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]], and [[Ultra Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

